            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps hidden with \"Hide in Docky\" stay out of Docky's pinned and running app surfaces until you restore them here.": {
      "comment": "A description of the functionality of the \"Restore\" section in the hidden apps settings view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用“在 Docky 中隐藏”隐藏的应用不会出现在 Docky 的固定区和运行中应用区域，直到你在此处恢复它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps installed on this Mac that aren't currently in your dock. Set their icon ahead of time and it'll be ready when you add them.": {
      "comment": "A section header describing apps that are installed on the user's Mac but aren't currently in their dock. These apps can have their icons customized via this view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装在这台 Mac 上但当前不在 Dock 中的应用。可提前为其设置图标，添加时即可直接使用。"
          }
