            "value": "原地"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include minimized windows in the window switcher and per-tile hover previews. They render dimmed with a \"(minimized)\" label so they stand out from active windows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将最小化的窗口纳入窗口切换器和逐图块悬停预览。它们会以变暗方式呈现，并带有“（已最小化）”标签，以便与活动窗口区分开来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Indicator Color": {
      "comment": "A color picker for the color of the activity indicator.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指示器颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Indicators": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indicadores"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指示器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Indicators, tile layout, window shape, window background, and the glass toggle will return to their defaults. App icons, behavior, widgets, and other settings are unaffected. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los indicadores, el diseño de íconos, la forma y el fondo de la ventana, y el interruptor de vidrio volverán a sus valores predeterminados. Los íconos de apps, el comportamiento, los widgets y otros ajustes no se ven afectados. Esto no se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指示器、图块布局、窗口外观、窗口背景和玻璃效果开关都将恢复默认值。应用图标、行为、小组件和其他设置不受影响。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inline": {
      "localizations": {
