            "value": "内边距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Padding between the dock panel and the chrome view, per edge. Full-axis mode forces these to 0 regardless.": {
      "comment": "A description of the content inset rows in the appearance settings view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dock 面板与外框视图之间按边设置的内边距。全部轴模式会无视此设置并强制将其归零。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paints the red notification count (like Mail's unread total) on running app tiles. Read from the system Dock, so it needs Accessibility permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在运行中的应用图块上绘制红色通知计数（例如邮件的未读总数）。数据读取自系统 Dock，因此需要辅助功能权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
