    "Widget bundles are loaded once per launch. New installs and removals take effect after a restart.": {
      "comment": "A description of how widget changes are applied after a restart.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小组件包每次启动仅加载一次。新安装和移除在重启后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widget installed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小组件已安装"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Loaded through L10n.text(_:) from a String-based API (NSAlert, NSMenuItem, help, accessibility)."
    },
    "Widgets": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Widgets"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小组件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Widgets are native plugins that run inside Docky with the same access Docky has — Accessibility, Automation, files, and more. Docky can't verify what a widget does. Only continue if you trust this source.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小组件是运行在 Docky 内部的原生插件，拥有与 Docky 相同的权限——辅助功能、自动化、文件访问等。Docky 无法核实小组件的实际行为。请仅在信任该来源时继续。"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Loaded through L10n.text(_:) from a String-based API (NSAlert, NSMenuItem, help, accessibility)."
    },
